{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56094","headline":"授经赞 · 杜光庭","name":"授经赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘飘太虚岭，流景在上玄。\n经始无终劫，常保天地人。\n国主学理世，道士诵得仙。\n贤者今奉受，依法以相传。\n时无至德子，保秘不妄宣。\n宗之昇太清，弃之堕九泉。\n我说无爲道，冲寂得自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}